{"id":"659718","name":"抹茶奥利奥冰激凌","author":"宅家吃货JACKERLU","authorId":"12121547","desc":"","cover":"images/659718/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"淡奶油","amount":"300克"},{"name":"牛奶","amount":"120克"},{"name":"抹茶粉","amount":"12克"},{"name":"白砂糖","amount":"80克"},{"name":"鸡蛋黄","amount":"3个"},{"name":"白巧克力","amount":"70克（可可脂30%含量）"}],"sub":[{"name":"奥利奥碎","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"淡奶油300克、牛奶120克，小火加热至微沸后离火。注：不停搅拌防止粘底。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/20240627171948927864887012121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":2,"desc":"抹茶粉12克提前过筛一下，倒入适量刚才的热奶液。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/20240627171948927917160112121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":3,"desc":"搅拌至抹茶粉完全融化。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/202406271719489299431912121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":4,"desc":"把抹茶液全都倒回奶液里。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/20240627171948930611393612121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":5,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/2024062717194893134033912121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":6,"desc":"白砂糖80克、鸡蛋黄3个，搅拌均匀。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/20240627171948932551848512121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入一半热抹茶奶液，搅拌均匀。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/2024062717194893322206412121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":8,"desc":"再全部倒回搅拌。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/20240627171948933795813312121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":9,"desc":"再加入白巧克力（可可脂30%含量）70克，加热2-3分钟搅拌均匀。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/20240627171948934330792212121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":10,"desc":"把巧克力完全融化，顺便把蛋黄烫熟消一下毒。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/20240627171948935008394412121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":11,"desc":"过筛2-3遍，去掉没溶解的大颗粒，放至完全凉透。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/20240627171948935487660912121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":12,"desc":"放凉后放冰箱冷冻1小时。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/20240627171948935915344812121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":13,"desc":"取出来打发至颜色变淡，体积变大。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/20240627171948936465017212121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":14,"desc":"继续冷冻1小时。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/20240627171948937132415912121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":15,"desc":"取出来打发均匀一下。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/202406271719489375683112121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":16,"desc":"再冷冻1小时。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/20240627171948938129182312121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":17,"desc":"取出来再打发均匀一下。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/20240627171948938689662212121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":18,"desc":"加入奥利奥碎适量。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/20240627171948939532046612121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":19,"desc":"翻拌均匀。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/20240627171948939968452212121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":20,"desc":"把冰激凌放入模具，冷冻6小时左右即可。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/20240627171948940415675312121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":21,"desc":"冷冻里取出来直接挖可能会有一点硬，可以放10分钟，会软一些，好挖一点。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/20240627171948940968394012121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":22,"desc":"抹茶奥利奥冰激凌，完成O(∩_∩)O","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/20240627171948941569226912121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":23,"desc":"当抹茶清香与奥利奥的酥脆碰撞在一起，带来一种无与伦比的美味体验。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/20240627171948942337222712121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":24,"desc":"绿意清凉，黑白风情：抹茶奥利奥冰激凌的绝妙滋味。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/20240627171948943220529512121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":25,"desc":"夏日必备，甜蜜冰爽：抹茶奥利奥冰激凌的奇妙味道。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/20240627171948943704494412121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"}],"tips":"1、尽量选择质量较好的抹茶粉，这样能够保证冰激凌的色泽和味道。\n2、在加热牛奶和蛋黄混合液时，火候一定要小，避免煮沸，否则会导致蛋黄凝固。\n3、搅拌打发至少要3次，再多几次最好，可以防止形成冰晶，影响口感。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：打蛋器\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}